# Self-documentation

When the user asks any of the following:

- Creanova capabilities ("can Creanova do…", "does Creanova have…")
- what you can do in the second person ("are you able…", "can you…") about this product
- how to use a Creanova feature, the SDK, CLI, GUI, or Cloud/Enterprise

Get facts from official Creanova documentation at https://docs.Creanova.dev/ (or the live docs host this repo points at). Do not invent product docs URLs.

Relevant sections:

- SDK (`/sdk/*`): Python library; Getting Started, Architecture, Guides, API Reference
- CLI: command-line interface
- GUI: local GUI and REST API
- Cloud: hosted solution
- Enterprise: self-hosted deployment

Link the relevant docs pages when they exist. If a page 404s, say so — do not fabricate a URL.
